Tsuki\",\"summary\":\"Movimiento, ataque y la sensación de cada golpe. Así ajustamos los controles antes de construir cualquier otra cosa.\",\"coverKey\":\"news_devlog02\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-08T18:00:00Z\"},{\"slug\":\"anunciamos-the-day-i-made-that-promise\",\"title\":\"Anunciamos The Day I Made That Promise\",\"summary\":\"Una promesa, una espada carmesí sin filo y unas islas que flotan sobre las nubes. Este es el primer juego de Hex Studio.\",\"coverKey\":\"news_announcement\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-30T16:00:00Z\"}],\"page\":{\"number\":1,\"size\":6,\"totalElements\":9,\"totalPages\":2}}"},"headersSize":280,"bodySize":989,"redirectURL":"","_transferSize":1269},"cache":{},"timings":{"dns":-1,"connect":-1,"ssl":-1,"send":0,"wait":20.607,"receive":2.074},"_monotonicTime":13963.654,"_serviceWorkerRef":"worker@b339aa538df9031487bb63f553521247","_resourceType":"fetch","serverIPAddress":"[::1]","_serverPort":4173,"_securityDetails":{}},{"pageref":"page@5f367840e8dae8d8f1416e2d492b8352","startedDateTime":"2026-11-22T21:53:08.255Z","time":26.845000000000002,"request":{"method":"GET","url":"http://localhost:4173/api/v1/news?page=1&size=6","httpVersion":"HTTP/1.1","cookies":[],"headers":[{"name":"sec-ch-ua-platform","value":"\"Windows\""},{"name":"Referer","value":"http://localhost:4173/news"},{"name":"User-Agent","value":"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) HeadlessChrome/156.0.8078.4 Safari/537.36"},{"name":"sec-ch-ua","value":"\"Not:A-Brand\";v=\"8\", \"Chromium\";v=\"156\", \"HeadlessChrome\";v=\"156\""},{"name":"Accept-Language","value":"es-MX"},{"name":"sec-ch-ua-mobile","value":"?0"}],"queryString":[{"name":"page","value":"1"},{"name":"size","value":"6"}],"headersSize":355,"bodySize":0},"response":{"status":200,"statusText":"OK","httpVersion":"HTTP/1.1","cookies":[],"headers":[{"name":"x-request-id","value":"e7c32280"},{"name":"cache-control","value":"max-age=300, public"},{"name":"connection","value":"close"},{"